  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Connect Papua New Guinea - Roads Repair - AIFFP loan to Papua New Guinea (Only the OECD reportable grant equivalent figure is reported)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment captures AIFFP&apos;s support for rehabilitation and maintenance of roads under the Government of Papua New Guinea&#x2019;s Connect PNG Infrastructure Development Program 2020-2040 (Connect PNG). Connect PNG aims to improve key economic road transport network connectivity to enhance support for sustainable socioeconomic development and national cohesion and unity. Australia&#x2019;s investment through AIFFP is enabling the Government of PNG to undertake long-term rehabilitation and maintenance along the Wau Highway in Morobe Province in PNG. This investment improves access for remote communities to essential services and makes travel safer through ensuring that the road is safe for both vehicle and pedestrian use. This investment covers only OECD reportable grant equivalent figures of loan disbursement, using the DAC calculator (40.398%).</narrative>
  </description>
